Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "jay@fitt.com", "password": "password123" }

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/identity/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "jay@fitt.com", "password": "password123" }

### Wrong password
POST http://localhost:8080/api/identity/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "jay@fitt.com", "password": "wrongpassword" }